n Dorothy's hometown, Lili faces her feelings. When they return to school, she's shocked by the results of the final assignment.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11483304/screencap/697655822ec75.jpg"},{"title":"Farewell on the Sea","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"202955","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63019","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"306762","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"470980","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"103694","synopsis":"While Lili sends a victory letter home, Kit faces the weight of aristocratic duty as Richard shares his worries about their role in the looming conflict.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11483305/screencap/6976560ce210d.jpg"},{"title":"Stormy Crossroads","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"202955","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63019","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"306762","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"470980","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"103695","synopsis":"Despite a sense of unease, everyone works on their final pieces as Kit attempts a brand new approach. Shin receives a confusing telegram from home.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11483306/screencap/69765632c31bd.jpg"},{"title":"Colorless Cubism of the Heart","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19743","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"202955","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider"